accTitle: ACP client and runtime
accDescr: The client talks to ACP on stdio. Core governs workspace tools and host capabilities. Permission and form requests return to the client.
client[客户端 / TUI / Desktop] -->|stdio ACP|acp[ACP 会话与协议适配]
acp --> core[Core Run 与受控执行]
core --> workspace[工作区 / 沙箱 / 工具]
core --> services[模型 / MCP / 宿主能力]
acp -->|权限 / 问题 / 表单|client
